<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc1">Paul ne Philemon dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philemon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phm.</para>
  <para style="mt">Philemon</para>
  <para style="mt">Paul ne Philemon dage raukegai laisiu</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Philemon au Colossae ngqwa ga muiteume ge nah Paul zangme ge. Philemon kilabe, Onesimus, pe dade rangkang regalu delwe Rome gage pak gaidi. Pa cika kebamdau pa Paul de redaulu delwe Khristianme ge teidi. Paul laisiu aide si eh Onesimus de langpwa Philemon dage kaigai. Pecu Onesimus mau gibeulo pe nggia kiegai nah pecu pak kela kila ge nzwa mene Khrista gade siname ge nzwa ngngwa lulo beu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiu kedui aide, Ephesame, Colossaeme, nah Philippime hebaangki laisiudung lie qula kedanemene cidungde Paul Rome ga hebaangki ga baang keraidau (AD 59-61 dauge) rau kegaine.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelumkegai (1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul lungnei nah keku (4-7)</para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimus ziemne Paul pe nggia kekie (8-22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kelamna sam (23-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="s">Keraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Paul, Khrista Jisu ziemne hebaang teikelabe, nah anui sinabe Timothy ne raupwa, Philemon, anui hungkela zangnabe nah nzang eh heta teikelabe dage,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Paul ne laisiu aide raugai, Timothy au kelumkegai sam rünne ga si.</char></note> <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />nah kenlum gade anui tipui Apphia, nah anui ngngwa reugwa zangbe tei kelabe Archippus, nah n ki gade ngkwa bam kelame dage kekai. <verse eid="PHM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Anui Peibe Tinggwang nah anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista dade lungciep nah ngaugia nnuida peu bam kelube tei lulo.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paul suiyi sam nah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ih a kekie gade ncu nsung eh a Tinggwang de twabam muila, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />kedanemene kenlumme peciakne ziemne nah Rampaube Jisu da n keku nah n kenlum kebamde siu kelune. <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />A kekie au n kenlum mide kelia ga peu n laikai teineu, iciu eh anui Khrista gade kebam makeyi leune nang ci canglu kerane. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />N keku de ziemne Ih a suiyi nah ziune kecu kiee sütlu, kedanemene sinabo, nang kemcimedung lung teiheci dai kebeune.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onesimus ziemne Paul pe nggia kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ciziemne, Ih Khrista gade nang tei maikesiabe ncu tei lulo aja kailu kebui kekuu leune bam, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />dede keku ziemne, Ih n dage kie gaila—Ih, Paul, kecingpei ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kecingpei ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Khrista Jisu ding keteibe</char></note>, nah cude Khrista Jisu ziemne hebaang keteibe. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Kenlum gade Ih a na Onesimus ziemne n dage kiela, Ih hebaang tei keladau pe rabe kilam pei teilu. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Piage n ziemne pa kemta kauge, dede pa cu au n ziemne de nah a ziemne de teumaikesiame ge dida. <verse eid="PHM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ih pecu, a mlungbe de n dage lang cailidai gaila. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Ih pecu peu ada bam neu, ciu eh pa n keleu gade Ih samliakeyi de ziemne hebaang tei kebamdau acu nghalu kerane. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Dede Ih n sui ci mene magede tei neuma, iciu eh n ta keyi de maikesia ziemne mene neungga eh teilu kerane. <verse eid="PHM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Kedanemene aide ziemne pa tingkakge n dade lamnadi au zie, iciu eh nang pecu kelungta ngngwa la dailu kerane, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />hebaangme ge nzwa mene, dede hebaangme ge swade yiki eh—kehung sinabe ge tei eh, keraide a ziemne, dede pumteih lamde nah Rampaube kilamde n ziemne au ciswade yiki dida. <verse eid="PHM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Cine, nang acu n zangbe lie eh luu lucai, nang acu ngngwalu kera nzwa pecu ngngwa lulo. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Dede pa n dage ma teimau pwa bamcai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ma teimau pwa bamcai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">N dade pak kedi gade, mede pa samting kelu teilu ta kedi. </char></note> mede n paudung pung lacai, cide a dade kie lulo. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Ih, Paul aide akatei a bale rau gaila. Ih ne cide ruidai beuzie—n teilung de agu lie kecu n dage rang meliede! <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Yeo, sinabo, Rampaube gade a suiyi tei beulo; Khrista gade a lung tei ramcim gailo. <verse eid="PHM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Nang a sam mzailu zieha de nlum eh Ih aide n dage raugaila, Ih kie kegaide swade nang kieeki eh tei beuzie kecu ci eh. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Dede ciciu kecu reude, a ziemne kibung ge mtei gailo, kedanemene n kekie tei pwapeu eh acu peu n da gwang dailu kera Ih keregui bamlu.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelamna sam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Epaphras, Khrista Jisu ziemne acu nzang eh hebaang keteibe, nnuide kelum gaila, <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />acu nzang heta tei kelame Mark, Aristarchus, Demas, nah Luke de ncu kelum gaila. <verse eid="PHM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Anui Rampaube Jisu Khrista ngaugia depeu nnui rabe de ngngwala kelube tei lulo. Amen.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>